flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Student logs in]
    B --> C{Is valid Student?}

    C -- Yes --> D[View Dashboard]
    C -- No --> E[Display Access Denied]
    E --> Z([End])

    D --> F[Select Event]
    F --> G[Fill Poster Details<br/>Title, Abstract]
    G --> H[Upload PDF Poster]
    H --> I{Validation successful?}

    I -- Yes --> J[Submit Poster]
    J --> K[System sets status to SUBMITTED]
    K --> L[Display Success Message]
    L --> Z

    I -- No --> M[Display Error Message]
    M --> Z
